Native position storage incorporates unmodified Eigen 3.4.1 Core headers.
Eigen is principally MPL-2.0; the selected EIGEN_MPL2_ONLY subset also contains
permissive notices. The MPL text, Apache text and included Core notices are
retained in licenses/eigen-mpl2.txt, licenses/eigen-apache.txt and
licenses/eigen-notices.txt, and accompany native/Python distributions.
Eigen source is available from https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen/-/tree/3.4.1
and the hash-pinned source archive declared in cmake/MeshvaleEigen.cmake.
No Eigen source modifications are made by Meshvale.

Optional Python extensions statically incorporate nanobind 3.1.0 (BSD-3-Clause)
and its bundled tsl::robin_map headers (MIT). Their original notices are retained
in licenses/nanobind.txt and licenses/robin-map.txt and packaged with Python builds.
